 You can get all the keys (`["A", "B", "C"]`) like this:

```
Object.keys(MyEnum);

```

 And the values (`["a", "b", "c"]`):

```
Object.keys(MyEnum).map(key => MyEnum[key])

```

 Or using Object.values() :

